{"title":"Sakura","slug":"Sakura","pageid":2923,"revid":21913,"timestamp":"2026-06-20T21:34:06Z","lastEditor":"Ilovechocolateyk","categories":["Trees"],"infobox":{"type":"Wood","fields":[{"label":"title","value":"Sakura"},{"label":"Island","value":"Flowering Meadows"},{"label":"Hardness","value":"?"},{"label":"Log","value":"$1.6/stud"},{"label":"Sanded","value":"$22.4/stud"},{"label":"Planked","value":"$28/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.54.0"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"textures","text":"Textures"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Sakura</b> tree is one of the various trees that can be found in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flowering_Meadows/\">Flowering Meadows</a> area. It appears as a purple tree, however wood coloration is a soft, light pink, also on it's leaves you can find <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Sakura_Blossom/\">Sakura Blossom</a>. The <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Petalfall/\">Petalfall</a> has a swing power bonus towards this tree that is similar to the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Emberbane/\">Emberbane</a>.\n</p><p>Like every other material in-game, it can be used to complete schematics.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"textures\">Textures</h2><p>\nThe various textures of the <b>Sakura</b> in its raw/log, sanded, and planked states.</p><div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"9f78881edab3d290d143462d0cbaa0a9\" data-seq-no=\"1\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"SakuraLogT-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Log\">Log</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Log\">Log</span></span></div></div><div>Log</div></div><div><div><div id=\"SakuraSandedT-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Sanded\">Sanded</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Sanded\">Sanded</span></span></div></div><div>Sanded</div></div><div><div><div id=\"SakuraPlankedT-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Planked\">Planked</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Planked\">Planked</span></span></div></div><div>Planked</div></div></div>\n\n</div>"}
